# Optional: To connect your official Google Cloud OAuth Client ID for live GIS authentication:
# 1. Create an OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Add http://localhost:5173 and http://127.0.0.1:5173 to Authorized JavaScript Origins
# 3. Paste the Client ID below:
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
